Z||000002||Oreif||07-11-2000||03:09 AM||||I think that came off of an 85 GT no SE as the ad says. First there was no aero package on the 85 SE's and the panels are silver which is only a GT thing. 86/87 SE had black for the aero stuff. Still that isn't a bad price right now.||||reg||1
Z||000003||286SE'S||07-11-2000||07:15 PM||||It may be from an 85. There is some overlap in the changes to the cars. He is also selling his sail panels and they both say SE on them. Just last weekend I pulled the headlight motors out of an '87 and it had ribbed molding. The '87 right next to it had round molding. They were both 87 according to the VIN numbers (HP). Also both had DIS ignitions. I took the little front molding tips off the ribbed one for my car.<BR>Terry||||reg||1
